           Cell["After the amplitudes above complete, run this export. One \
C++ process contains the helicity family. It builds SPINAS and compares the \
squared amplitudes with CalcHEP and MadGraph at 1000 phase-space points each. \
The complete reports and random seeds remain in the Export variable.",
            "Text"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["sm5eEhhhExport = \
WriteSPINASProcess[\n  FileNameJoin[{spinasOutputDirectory, \"eebarhhh\"}],\n \
 {\"e\", \"E\"} -> {\"h\", \"h\", \"h\"},\n  {\n    {sm5eEhhhParticles, \
sm5eEhhhAmplitude}\n  }, sm,\n  \"ProcessName\" -> \"sm5eebarhhh\", Sequence \
@@ validationOptions];\nIf[AssociationQ[sm5eEhhhExport], \
sm5eEhhhExport[\"Directory\"], sm5eEhhhExport]", "Input", CellTags ->
